# Text To Speech Implementation

Example:

```typescript
speak(message:string){


 const speech =
 new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(message);


 speech.lang="en-US";


 window.speechSynthesis
 .speak(speech);


}
```

Usage:

```typescript
this.speak(
"Your premium is five thousand rupees"
);
```

Output:

```
🔊 Your premium is five thousand rupees
```

