# Important Speech Features

---

# 1. Wake Word Detection

Wake word means a specific word that activates the assistant.

Example:

```
Hey SBI
```

Flow:

```
Microphone Listening
          |
          ↓
Detect Wake Word
          |
          ↓
Activate Assistant
          |
          ↓
Start Conversation
```

Use case:

AI insurance assistant opens when user says:

```
Hey SBI
```

---

# 2. Voice Commands

User can control application using voice.

Example:

User:

```
Open customer form
```

Speech converts into:

```
open customer form
```

Application action:

```typescript
this.router.navigate([
 '/customer-form'
]);
```

---

# 3. Voice Form Filling

User speaks information:

Example:

```
My name is Karan
My age is 21
I need life insurance
```

AI extracts information:

```
Name = Karan

Age = 21

Policy = Life Insurance
```

Angular form update:

```typescript
this.insuranceForm.patchValue({

 name:"Karan",

 age:21,

 policy:"Life Insurance"

});
```

